   }
  ],
  "texto": [
   "Reaffirmed: 2026",
   "Ongoing Operations Adjusted EBITDA: $6,800 – $7,600 million",
   "Ongoing Operations Adjusted FCFbG: $3,925 – $4,725 million",
   "As of Aug. 3, 2026, Vistra had hedged approximately 100% of its expected generation volumes for 2026, approximately 94% for 2027, and approximately 72% for 2028. The company's comprehensive hedging program provides support for the reaffirmed 2026 guidance ranges and the previously announced Ongoing Operations Adjusted EBITDA midpoint opportunity 2 range of $7.4 billion to $7.8 billion for 2027. 3 The ranges exclude any potential benefits from the pending acquisition of Cogentrix and the signed p",
   "As of Aug. 3, 2026:",
   "Vistra executed ~$6.5 billion in share repurchases since November 2021.",
   "Vistra had ~336 million shares outstanding, representing a ~30% reduction of the amount of the shares outstanding on Nov. 2, 2021.",
   "~$1.2 billion of the share repurchase authorization remained available, which we expect to complete no later than year-end 2027."
  ],
  "titulo": "Guidance",
  "fuente": "SEC EDGAR · 8-K, Exhibit 99.1 (texto original)",
  "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1692819/000169281926000017/vistra-20260630xearningsre.htm",
  "texto_es": [
   "Reafirmada: 2026",
   "EBITDA ajustado de operaciones continuadas: 6.800–7.600 M$",
   "Caja libre ajustada antes de crecimiento (FCFbG) de operaciones continuadas: 3.925–4.725 M$",
   "A 3 de agosto de 2026, Vistra tenía cubierta aproximadamente el 100% de su producción prevista para 2026, cerca del 94% para 2027 y cerca del 72% para 2028. Su programa de coberturas respalda las horquillas reafirmadas de 2026 y la oportunidad ya anunciada para el punto medio del EBITDA ajustado de operaciones continuadas (2), de 7.400 a 7.800 M$ en 2027. (3) Las horquillas no incluyen los posibles beneficios de la compra pendiente de Cogentrix ni del…",
   "A 3 de agosto de 2026:",
   "Vistra ha recomprado acciones por unos 6.500 M$ desde noviembre de 2021.",
   "Vistra tenía unos 336 millones de acciones en circulación, cerca de un 30% menos que el 2 de noviembre de 2021.",
   "Quedaban disponibles unos 1.200 M$ de la autorización de recompra, que espera completar como muy tarde a finales de 2027."
  ]
 },
